OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy cloud
OL,6,Fand scattered showers continuing into
OL,7,Fthe evening and overnight, yet showers
OL,8,Feasing. A chillier night than the
OL,9,Flast, particularly for inland rural
OL,10,Fareas. Winds strengthening into the
OL,11,Fearly hours feeling rather gusty on
OL,12,Fwestern coasts and hills.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FSunny spells with any
OL,15,Fshowers fading through the morning.
OL,16,FTurning dry for a time yet becoming
OL,17,Fincreasingly cloudy into the
OL,18,Fafternoon. Rain arriving later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
