OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith rain on Friday, heavy over
OL,7,Fwestern hills. This clearing
OL,8,Fsoutheastwards midday onwards, leaving
OL,9,Fpatchy cloud with scattered showers
OL,10,Finto Saturday, turning drier
OL,11,Fthroughout Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
